<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-04T06:46:23.635Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:46:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue abducting civilians and attacking security forces across northern Nigeria, with recent incidents including the kidnapping of a university student in Plateau, the abduction of two visually impaired persons in Plateau, and the seizure of 14 schoolchildren from a farm. Security operatives have rescued multiple victims, such as eight abducted residents in Kaduna, a pregnant woman and seven others in Kaduna, and a group of 37 worshippers held for 212 days in Kaduna. Bandits have killed vigilantes, including a 18‑year-old in Plateau and a young woman in Bauchi, and police officers in a Sokoto-Zamfara highway ambush. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxObXV6MGtFZkFOYzgzZElZalBkdzQyeVg2cmcwLWRURmZLTEhsZ0J1dWpvQzE5eFVFZ05qN2M4SktHR3diYnN4Wk1HQlVheS1LN1NUNDIxcWY1R1lBX1pJUHVuVE4tdUc3bUtyWXB6WXRZdldudkNsTDVDVU9qOXRybkNxQ2dvVGlfVTNWN2tIdl8wemMyQUxhTlc4aFZnWGdXYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOMjBQajZmRWZBdTJxZlcybnpQZHgtMEg4WVFaazNucUs2dUNxbTIzMWJOQTFVRGxnc2NvWFpkVDFVYUtMRkVUT1ozZUh5S0pSbENaUk5obVJuZHQxWjRtVUtWdVdiUDd5YzM2Sm5uLTN0VVlPN0pqTGRWbmVHZnVRU0xtS1Fkc3gyZGtBSV9NQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQalgtZ0Jzc0hGT0RDdXdpdmFjWk5UTjFfbU5BTDN5T1VOUHc1NC0tMW1nTC1KUl9qNll3TjZudmw5MHptTGRFSXozTGVfNjhLRW93UFV2NTR0VnVZY2dERnpIeU45bndCOWJqa0tmODh0d1dJYmYtVFdTY2hGS2tnUjBhWkpwdXVIb0RSZ3hmWUtZTkh6Y3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Politics Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBfUHRGRDcyeVdiYUYtaS0wOGlycHpjeGNTSkxGLXk2blpaUnRQcWliRUZhNFFyeVlYdlMtZFFJMmtFQjVvSkV2TzFmODNvRDQ0ZGozb2d3dmhFQUxxeW45VE1mWmpkbDFmeHU3c